Labeled Matt Lehman on same-sex-marriage as **rung 5** (chair-shaped), based on his co-authorship of HJR 3 (2014) and his Yea vote on its House third reading (Roll Call 70). The resolution's sole operative text — defining marriage as only between one man and one woman — matches rung 5's clauses directly, and his vote was far from near-unanimous (57–40), so it supports the chair. Written to `labels/coder-3.json`.
